                "title": "Modern Disc Crystal Knob with Round Rosette",
                "description": "The Modern Disc Crystal Knob with Round Rosette is very now--a beautiful blending of hard and soft. The Modern Disc Crystal Knobset with #2 Rose paired with the contemporarily shaped round rosette is available in passage, privacy, and dummy functions. It will fit doors 1-3/8 inches to 3 inches thick and has an optional backset for either 2-3/8 inches or 2-3/4 inches. The #2 Rosette is available in flat black bronze, medium bronze, and white bronze finishes. \r\n",
